<item>
  <title><![CDATA[A Rack, Edited]]></title>
  <link>http://localhost:8885/2026/10/22/a-rack-edited/</link>
  <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
  <dc:creator>marketing</dc:creator>
  <guid isPermaLink="false">http://localhost:8885/2026/10/22/a-rack-edited/</guid>
  <description/>
  <content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The most persuasive shop windows lately are nearly empty. One rack, a single jacket, white curtains. The restraint is the message.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Editing a wardrobe works the same way. Take everything out. Put back only what you reached for last month. What remains is not a capsule — it is a portrait.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Empty space is not absence. It is the frame that lets one good thing be seen.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
